#====================================================================
# Draft: In conan 2.x, AutotoolsToolchain.generate() called without an
#        argument rebuilds a fresh Environment() internally -- every
#        unset()/prepend() made on the instance returned by
#        tc.environment() is silently dropped. Must call
#        tc.generate(env=env). Companion facts found in the same
#        session: conanrunenv aggregates only direct requires' libdirs
#        into LD_LIBRARY_PATH, and CMakeDeps generates config files for
#        direct requires only (test_package must re-require the
#        transitive dependency explicitly).
#====================================================================

id:                     DRAFT-CONAN-TOOLCHAIN-GENERATE-ENV-DROPPED-PKG-CONFIG-PATH
trigger_tool:           conan
phase:                  packaging
error_signature:        no LCMAPS basic interface found|checking for .*_INTERFACE... no|PKG_CONFIG_PATH.*丢失|conanautotoolstoolchain.sh

severity:               2
category:               conan|packaging|dependency-injection
match_keywords:         conan 2.x, AutotoolsToolchain, generate, environment, Environment, PKG_CONFIG_PATH, R49, pkg-config, dependency injection, conanrunenv, LD_LIBRARY_PATH, CMakeDeps, find_package, test_package, silent drop

title:                  conan 2.x AutotoolsToolchain.generate() 无参调用静默丢弃 tc.environment() 的修改（env=None 时内部重建 Environment 实例）：必须 tc.generate(env=env)；同族陷阱——conanrunenv 只聚直接依赖 libdirs、CMakeDeps 只为直接 requires 生成 config

root_cause:             AutotoolsToolchain.generate(self, env=None, scope="build") 的实现是 env = env or self.environment()，而 environment() 每次调用都新建 Environment() 实例（CC/CFLAGS 等在其中逐项 define）。对 tc.environment() 返回实例的 unset()/prepend() 修改因此全部丢失，且无任何警告——PKG_CONFIG_PATH 注入（R49 依赖注入模式）静默失效，configure 探测依赖接口报 "no ... interface found"。
affected_scope:         所有 conanfile.py 里"取 tc.environment() 改一改再 generate()"的模式（PKG_CONFIG_PATH 注入、unset 污染变量、链接器覆盖）；AutotoolsToolchain 有 env 参数存在此坑，CMakeToolchain.generate() 无 env 参数无此问题。
verification_cmd:       grep PKG_CONFIG_PATH <build>/generators/conanautotoolstoolchain.sh   # 修复后应含自定义路径，修复前只有 generators folder 默认值
rec_priority:           3
rec_approach:           pass-modified-env-to-generate
rec_description:        (1) 显式传回同一实例：env = tc.environment(); env.prepend/unset(...); tc.generate(env=env)；(2) 同族陷阱 A——test_package 的 conanrunenv 只聚合直接 require 的 libdirs，传递依赖包的 lib 不在 LD_LIBRARY_PATH，test() 里手动构造 LD_LIBRARY_PATH='<fw>/lib:<tested>/lib/lcmods' 前缀调用；(3) 同族陷阱 B——CMakeDeps 只为直接 requires 生成包 config，test_package 要 find_package 传递依赖时需显式 self.requires("<dep>/<ver>")（版本与主配方同步维护）；(4) 改完检查生成物 conanautotoolstoolchain.sh 确认注入值已序列化。
rec_command:            python3 -c "import inspect, conan.tools.gnu.autotoolstoolchain as m; print(inspect.getsource(m.AutotoolsToolchain.generate))"   # 确认 env = env or self.environment()
rec_auto_fix:           false

